                                                        <div><strong>Linked Sub-Attachments:</strong> {item.compatible_sub_attachment_ids?.length ? subAttachments.filter(s => item.compatible_sub_attachment_ids.includes(s.id)).map(s => s.material_name).join(', ') : 'None'}</div>
                                                    </div>
